WHAT THIS COVERS

The original work in this repository, namely:

  - the pipeline (pipeline/, build_dist.py, deploy_gh_pages.py, serve.py)
  - the web application (web/index.html, web/*.js, web/style.css)
  - the affluence index and its component definitions
  - the modelled small-area income distribution and band estimates
  - the travel connections rating
  - the documentation, including README.md and ATTRIBUTION.md

These were conceived, written and validated by the copyright holder. The
modelled figures in particular are constructed here; they are not published
statistics, and no upstream publisher is responsible for them or has any claim
over them. The methods are set out in README.md.


WHAT THIS DOES NOT COVER

The third-party data the pipeline consumes and the files it derives from that
data. Those carry their own licences, which are set out in full in
ATTRIBUTION.md and summarised here:

  - Most sources are Open Government Licence v3.0: attribution required,
    commercial use permitted, no share-alike.
  - Two published files, web/data/gb_branches.json and web/data/gb_places.json,
    are derived from OpenStreetMap and are therefore offered under the Open
    Database Licence (ODbL), as ATTRIBUTION.md records.

Nothing in this file purports to license third-party data, and nothing in those
third-party licences transfers ownership of the original work above.


